"775\" y=\"722\" font-size=\"17\" fill=\"#fff\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Arial\">try time-dilation problems</text><text x=\"775\" y=\"746\" font-size=\"17\" fill=\"#888\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Arial\">follow new wave discoveries</text><path d=\"M130 830 Q250 790 370 830 Q490 870 610 830 Q730 790 850 830 Q920 850 980 830\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#ffd700\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><circle cx=\"200\" cy=\"812\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#6366f1\"/><circle cx=\"450\" cy=\"843\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#ec4899\"/><circle cx=\"700\" cy=\"812\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#14b8a6\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"915\" font-size=\"23\" fill=\"#fff\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Arial\">The gift was a way of seeing. It is yours now.</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"965\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#ffd700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Arial\">Go use it.</text></svg>",
      "caption": "Einstein's real legacy was trusting one clear idea far enough to see the universe anew, a way of seeing that is now yours to carry forward."
